lues being 0.164 and 0.122, which the ligand-level sensitivity analysis reports in full at both units. The direction of the pattern is nonetheless coherent rather than arbitrary, since the real modulators are halogenated lipophilic compounds and the benchmark library is comparatively polar and hydrogen-bond driven.

